abstract: An experimental single-file Python tool for task state, local snapshots, designated evidence storage and coordination between AI coding agents in Git repositories. This source preview has known recovery and guard-coverage limitations and is intended for inspection and disposable evaluation. It does not establish the correctness of research results or provide a backup guarantee.
